    "created_at": "2020-05-19T05:34:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-19T05:34:39Z",
    "body": "Yeah, there's an opportunity for some good, but I think the user agent mostly has to design its UI around that not happening at which point it's unclear that having it places the right incentives on user agents.\r\n\r\nIt might also be surprising to the user as other things they configure this way cannot be silently revoked, though I suppose there's nothing preventing the user agent from letting the user confirm the unregistering.",
