    "created_at": "2024-07-31T09:26:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-07-31T09:26:49Z",
    "body": "This was added in https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/931c9ad82edc3c504d1a1d149174257772a31d80\r\n\r\nRationale: https://lists.whatwg.org/pipermail/whatwg-whatwg.org/2011-August/075259.html\r\n\r\n>>  2. Introduce an unregisterProtocolHandler() function.\r\n>> \r\n>> Such a function is desirable because it allows sites to remove outdated \r\n>> handlers from clients and would enable clients to provide a UI for \r\n>> managing their registered protocol handlers.\r\n>\r\n> Agreed.\r\n\r\n(`isProtocolHandlerRegistered` was removed in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/3027)",
